00:20:52.940 --> 00:20:56.140
But ultimately, that is a really positive development.

00:20:56.140 --> 00:20:59.580
They are acting as a strict auditor to protect you as a patient.

00:20:59.580 --> 00:21:03.020
Yeah, they're cracking down on dangerous drug combinations

00:21:03.100 --> 00:21:05.900
and demanding actual measurable improvements

00:21:05.900 --> 00:21:08.220
in your physical and mental well-being over time.

00:21:08.780 --> 00:21:11.260
And while the national averages are dropping

00:21:11.260 --> 00:21:14.060
and major organizations are losing their top tier status,

00:21:14.780 --> 00:21:17.820
this deep dive proves that achieving perfection

00:21:17.820 --> 00:21:20.700
under these new rules is entirely possible.

00:21:20.700 --> 00:21:23.180
But the roadmap to that perfection

00:21:23.180 --> 00:21:25.420
isn't where the industry expected it to be.

00:21:25.420 --> 00:21:25.740
Right.

00:21:26.700 --> 00:21:29.660
The roadmap isn't sitting in a massive corporate server farm

00:21:29.660 --> 00:21:31.500
in New York or Los Angeles.

00:21:31.500 --> 00:21:32.460
It's in Puerto Rico.

00:21:33.100 --> 00:21:35.900
Highly coordinated, community-focused models are proving

00:21:35.900 --> 00:21:39.740
that top-tier care can scale to hundreds of thousands of people,

00:21:39.740 --> 00:21:42.140
even against immense economic headwinds

00:21:42.140 --> 00:21:43.580
and systemic funding challenges.

00:21:44.220 --> 00:21:47.580
Which leads us with the ultimate healthcare paradox to consider.

00:21:48.220 --> 00:21:51.500
If a jurisdiction facing immense financial hurdles

00:21:51.500 --> 00:21:53.660
and lower federal reimbursement rates

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:56.380
can construct a network where nearly half a million people

00:21:56.380 --> 00:21:59.820
receive the absolute highest standard of Medicare Advantage care,

00:22:00.460 --> 00:22:03.260
well, maybe the secret to five-star healthcare

00:22:03.260 --> 00:22:05.340
is less about having limitless funding

00:22:05.900 --> 00:22:09.660
and more about having genuine boots on the ground community integration.

00:22:09.660 --> 00:22:10.620
Exactly.

